   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "The derivative of a product is NOT the product of the derivatives. Use (fg)′ = f′g + fg′: derivative of the first times the second, plus the first times the derivative of the second. You can check by expanding first."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "የብዜት ዴሪቫቲቭ የዴሪቫቲቮች ብዜት አይደለም። (fg)′ = f′g + fg′።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
